{"3881570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One and the Same", "steam_appid": 3881570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzles and Possession</u></strong><br><br><strong>One and the Same</strong> is an atmospheric puzzle-horror game in which you exist without a body—and must possess the strange inhabitants of this world to progress. You'll face puzzles that test your spatial awareness and ingenuity. These puzzles can only be solved by moving from figure to figure, manipulating them in an uncanny collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Whispers of Secrets Long Buried</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world itself murmurs a story—one pieced together not with words, but with fragments of the past. Echoes of a history long past are scattered across ruined halls. A story told without a single word. For the vigilant, deeper secrets lie buried—locked behind hidden puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you may come to suspect that the greatest mystery is yourself. What are you? Why are you here? And why does the clock tower beckon?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzles and Possession</u></strong><br><br><strong>One and the Same</strong> is an atmospheric puzzle-horror game in which you exist without a body—and must possess the strange inhabitants of this world to progress. You'll face puzzles that test your spatial awareness and ingenuity. These puzzles can only be solved by moving from figure to figure, manipulating them in an uncanny collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Whispers of Secrets Long Buried</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world itself murmurs a story—one pieced together not with words, but with fragments of the past. Echoes of a history long past are scattered across ruined halls. A story told without a single word. For the vigilant, deeper secrets lie buried—locked behind hidden puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you may come to suspect that the greatest mystery is yourself. What are you? Why are you here? And why does the clock tower beckon?</p>", "short_description": "Fall into the unsettling world of One and the Same. Solve puzzles and explore by possessing strange figures. Piece together the history of a forgotten land—and the truth of your own lost past.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881570/e2523a8ba1aacc807feeed12341abec97a699445/header.jpg?t=1753549593", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881570/e9e1c9f06e71095e23c12fb04cd0c932c1ed6ca0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753549593", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881570/e9e1c9f06e71095e23c12fb04cd0c932c1ed6ca0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753549593", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any dual-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050ti / AMD RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BasVek"], "publishers": ["Basvek"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"i